 law, a court order or a lawful request from an authority, or to protect the safety of pupils or others.',

    's9_heading' => '9. Information stored outside Uganda',
    's9_body'    => 'Our hosting and storage are in the European Union, and some providers process information in other countries. Uganda\'s Data Protection and Privacy Act 2019 allows personal information to be processed outside Uganda only where adequate protection is in place or the people concerned consent <strong>[lawyer to confirm the section and the basis we rely on]</strong>. We choose providers with strong security and contractual protections for this reason.',

    's10_heading' => '10. Cookies',
    's10_body'    => 'KlassApp sets only the cookies it needs to work. We do not use advertising or tracking cookies.<br><br><table class="w-full text-sm text-left border border-gray-200 my-4"><thead class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-700"><tr><th class="p-3 border">Cookie</th><th class="p-3 border">Purpose</th><th class="p-3 border">How long</th></tr></thead><tbody class="text-gray-700"><tr><td class="p-3 border align-top">klassapp_session</td><td class="p-3 border align-top">Keeps you signed in during a visit</td><td class="p-3 border align-top">2 hours of inactivity</td></tr><tr><td class="p-3 border align-top">XSRF-TOKEN</td><td class="p-3 border align-top">Protects forms against forgery</td><td class="p-3 border align-top">Your visit</td></tr><tr><td class="p-3 border align-top">remember_web_*</td><td class="p-3 border align-top">Keeps you signed in if you tick "Remember me"</td><td class="p-3 border align-top">Until you sign out</td></tr></tbody></table>Pages load fonts from Google Fonts, which receives your device\'s IP address when the page loads <strong>[to confirm, or remove if fonts are served by KlassApp]</strong>.',

    's11_heading' => '11. How long we keep information',
    's11_body'    => '<table class="w-full text-sm text-left border border-gray-200 my-4"><thead class="bg-gray-100 text-gray-700"><tr><th class="p-3 border">Information</th><th class="p-3 border">How long</th></tr></thead><tbody class="text-gray-700"><tr><td class="p-3 border align-top">School records (pupils, staff, marks, fees, attendance, messages)</td><td class="p-3 border align-top">For as long as the school uses KlassApp. When a school closes its account, we delete or return its records within <strong>[90]</strong> days, except where the law requires us to keep them</td></tr><tr><td class="p-3 border align-top">Report card files sent by WhatsApp</td><td class="p-3 border align-top">Deleted within 2 hours</td></tr><tr><td class="p-3 border align-top">Sign-up verification codes</td><td class="p-3 border align-top">Expire after 15 minutes</td></tr><tr><td class="p-3 border align-top">Password reset codes</td><td class="p-3 border align-top">Expire after 5 minutes</td></tr><tr><td class="p-3 border align-top">Staff invitation links</td><td class="p-3 border align-top">72 hours</td></tr><tr><td class="p-3 border align-top">School invitation links</td><td class="p-3 border align-top">7 days</td></tr><tr><td class="p-3 border align-top">Backups</td><td class="p-3 border align-top"><strong>[confirm the backup schedule on the current hosting before publication]</strong></td></tr><tr><td class="p-3 border align-top">Security and activity records</td><td class="p-3 border align-top"><strong>[12 months, once automatic deletion is enabled]</strong></td></tr><tr><td class="p-3 border align-top">Demo and contact requests, and people who contact us without an account</td><td class="p-3 border align-top"><strong>[24 months]</strong>, or sooner if you ask</td></tr></tbody></table>',

    's12_heading' => '12. How we protect information',
    's12_body'    => '<ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1"><li>All connections to KlassApp are encrypted (HTTPS).</li><li>Passwords and codes are stored only in hashed form.</li><li>Uploaded files are kept in private storage and shown only through links that expire.</li><li>Backups are encrypted <strong>[confirm once the backup encryption key is in place]</strong>.</li><li>Access inside a school depends on each person\'s role, and sensitive views are recorded.</li><li>Messages arriving from WhatsApp are accepted only when they carry Meta\'s signature.</li><li>Only authorised KlassApp staff can access production systems, and only when needed.</li></ul><br>If a data breach affects your information, we will inform the affected school and, where the law requires, the Personal Data Protection Office, without undue delay.',

    's13_heading' => '13. Your rights',
    's13_body'    => 'Under Uganda\'s Data Protection and Privacy Act 2019 you have the right to know what information is held about you, to ask for a copy, to ask for corrections, to object to processing, and to ask for deletion where it is no longer needed. Parents and guardians can exercise these rights for their children. If you live in another country, the rights under your country\'s law also apply.<br><br>For school records, please contact your school first; we help the school respond. For information KlassApp holds as controller, contact us (section 16). We will reply within <strong>[30]</strong> days.',

